author ai
group cli
note The read-only half of the CLI: the commands that answer questions about the source rather than the map. files, symbols, show and search all walk the in-memory Index directly, and every one of them prints one item per line in a file:line shape so the output can be pasted back into another command or parsed like grep output. Each is a method on exec.rs's Run that walks the index, with the row formats in wire.rs. These four are what the agent falls back to when no tour covers the code it needs.

